      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Load, write, read back.\n\n1. PD Load reads example.png from ComfyUI's input folder. To load your own file, paste its full path (shift+right click > Copy as path in Explorer) into file or base_path.\n2. Repeat Image Batch makes 5 frames; PD Output writes them as an EXR sequence (sRGB to linear) with a sidecar.\n3. A second PD Load takes PD Output's path (the first frame). sequence_from_file loads the whole sequence, linear to sRGB undoes the conversion, and its context output carries the sidecar's tokens.\n\nPress load on a PD Load to run just that node."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Load, write, read back.\n\n1. PD Load reads example.png from ComfyUI's input folder. To load your own file, paste its full path (shift+right click > Copy as path in Explorer) into file or base_path.\n2. Repeat Image Batch makes 5 frames; PD Output writes them as an EXR sequence (sRGB to linear) with a sidecar.\n3. A second PD Load takes PD Output's path (the first frame). sequence_from_file loads the whole sequence, linear to sRGB undoes the conversion, and its context output carries the sidecar's tokens.\n\nPress load on a PD Load to run just that node."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
